OL,3,GNEWSA'New York coffee stop on 9/11
OL,4,Asaved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was in New York during the
OL,7,F9/11 terror attacks said he would have
OL,8,Fbeen at the twin towers when the planes
OL,9,Fhit if he not stopped for a coffee.
OL,11,FNearly 3,000 people were killed when
OL,12,Ftwo of the four planes hijacked by
OL,13,FAl-Qaeda terrorists were used to crash
OL,14,Finto the World Trade Centre on the
OL,15,Fmorning of 11 September 2001.
OL,17,FPaul Lilley, manager of HSBC in
OL,18,FChippenham at the time, was in New York
OL,19,Fwith his wife Wendy for their 20th
OL,20,Fwedding anniversary.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
